{title: Tuyo Soy (I Am Yours)}
{artist: Larry Holder}
{key: C}
{time: 3/4}
{tempo: 94}

Verse 1
Mi [C]Cristo, mi [Em]Cristo,
La [Am]Luz de mi [Em]alma,
La Espe[F]ranza de mi [C]vida,
Y el Se[Dm]ñor de [G7]todos.
Mi [C]Cristo, mi [Em]Cristo,
Me has sal[Am]vado, me has sal[Em]vado,
Y Te [F]digo, por [G7]siempre,
Tuyo [C]soy.[G7]

Verse 2
My [C]Jesus, my [Em]Jesus,
The [Am]Light of my [Em]soul,
The [F]Hope of my [C]life,
And the [Dm]Lord of [G7]all.
My [C]Jesus, my [Em]Jesus,
You have [Am]saved me, You have [Em]saved me,
And I [F]tell You that for[G7]ever,
I am [C]Yours.[G7]

Verse 3
Je[C]sús, mi [Em]Dios,
Tú has [Am]hecho el [Em]mundo,
Y has [F]hecho mi [C]alma
Para vi[Dm]vir en Tu a[G]mor.
Je[F]sús, Tú muri[G]ó,
Para que yo [E]puedo [E7]vi[Am]vir,
[Am/G]Y Te [F]digo, por [G7]siempre,
Tuyo [C]soy.[G7]

Verse 4
My [C]Jesus, my [Em]God,
You have [Am]made all the [Em]world,
And You have [F]made my very [C]soul
To a[Dm]bide in Your [G]love.
My [F]Jesus, You [G]died
So that [E]I now [E7]may [Am]live,
[Am/G]And I [F]tell You that for[G7]ever
I am [C]Yours.[G7]

Verse 5
(Repeat 1, add flute)

